relay-tools (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch packaging to dh-virtualenv: bundle all Python dependencies,
    including the MCP SDK (mcp extra), in /opt/venvs/relay-tools.
  * Expose CLI entry points via /usr/bin symlinks; point systemd units
    at them.
  * Package is now architecture-specific (bundled compiled wheels).

